      "statement": "Discovery works out the local /24 subnet from the socket's own address, then probes every address from .1 to .254 with an HTTP request to port 8001 using 60 threads and a 0.8 second timeout, and treats an address as a TV when its device type contains Samsung or its model contains FRAME.",
